<title>CANADA: Finning to issue C$75 mln in 10-yr debt.</title>
<headline>Finning to issue C$75 mln in 10-yr debt.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finning Ltd said on Thursday it agreed with underwriters to issue C$75 million in 10-year unsecured debentures.</p>
<p>Finning said it plans to file a preliminary prospectus on November 25, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
